OL,3,ASeven dead and more than 100 injured
OL,4,Aafter trains collide in Egypt
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least seven people have died in a
OL,7,Ftrain crash near the Egyptian city of
OL,8,FGiza, with more than 100 injured.
OL,10,FThe country's railway authority said
OL,11,Ftwo trains travelling south from Giza
OL,12,Fand Cairo collided, causing several
OL,13,Fcarriages to derail and fall down an
OL,14,Fembankment.
OL,16,FImages from the scene showed people
OL,17,Flooking inside overturned carriages for
OL,18,Finjured passengers as a massive
OL,19,Femergency response was launched.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
